PORTRAITS — magnifica/src/portraits.ts
--------------------------------------

Sixteen photographs of real people, each a freely-licensed image from Wikimedia
Commons under CC0, Public Domain, CC BY 2.0/3.0/4.0 or CC BY-SA 2.0/3.0/4.0.
The specific photographer and licence for each is recorded in portraits.ts and
RENDERED ON SCREEN beside the image. Removing a credit is a licence breach, not
a design change.

The CC BY-SA images carry a share-alike condition: an adapted version must be
released under the same licence. That condition travels with the image and is
not waived by anything in this repository.

Related: magnifica/ASSETS.md records the project's own rule that no generated
likeness of a real person may be used.

HOT-LINKED IMAGES
